0">は</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">向我伸出的那只手</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">oide to sashinobeta te wa</span></p><p begin="47.380" end="54.100" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">思</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="47.380" end="47.660">お</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="47.660" end="48.260">も</span></span></span><span begin="48.260" end="48.460">え</span><span begin="48.460" end="49.120">ば</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">何</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="49.120" end="49.560">な</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="49.560" end="49.940">に</span></span></span><span begin="49.940" end="50.180">よ</span><span begin="50.180" end="50.560">り</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">眩</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="50.800" end="51.020">ま</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="51.020" end="51.580">ぶ</span></span></span><span begin="51.580" end="51.840">し</span><span begin="51.840" end="52.700">かっ</span><span begin="52.700" end="54.100">た</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">回想起来比什么都耀眼</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">omoeba nani yori mabushikatta</span></p><p begin="55.400" end="1:01.440" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">吹</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="55.400" end="55.900">ふ</span></span></span><span begin="55.900" end="56.313">い</span><span begin="56.313" end="56.900">てっ</span><span begin="56.900" end="57.840">た</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">淡</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="58.360" end="58.800">あ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="58.800" end="59.260">わ</span></span></span><span begin="59.260" end="59.640">い</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">風</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="59.640" end="1:00.260">か</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:00.260" end="1:01.440">ぜ</span></span></span><span ttm:role="x-translation">轻拂而过的淡色微风</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">fuitetta awai kaze</span></p><p begin="1:02.083" end="1:07.800" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:02.083" end="1:02.800">そっ</span><span begin="1:02.800" end="1:03.760">と</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">頬</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:04.260" end="1:04.633">ほ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:04.633" end="1:05.007">お</span></span></span><span begin="1:05.007" end="1:05.380">を</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">撫</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:05.380" end="1:05.980">な</span></span></span><span begin="1:05.980" end="1:06.240">で</span><span begin="1:06.240" end="1:07.800">る</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">悄然抚过我的脸颊</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">sotto hō o naderu</span></p><p begin="1:09.340" end="1:12.780" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">同</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:09.340" end="1:09.780">お</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:09.780" end="1:10.000">な</span></span></span><span begin="1:10.000" end="1:10.240">じ</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">時</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:10.240" end="1:10.400">と</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:10.400" end="1:10.660">き</span></span></span><span begin="1:10.660" end="1:11.020">を</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">過</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:11.020" end="1:11.280">す</span></span></span><span begin="1:11.280" end="1:11.660">ご</span><span begin="1:11.660" end="1:12.160">し</span><span begin="1:12.160" end="1:12.780">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">明明共同度过的时光</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">onaji toki o sugoshite</span></p><p begin="1:13.200" end="1:22.260" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">心</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:13.200" end="1:13.420">こ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:13.423" end="1:13.640">こ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:13.640" end="1:13.840">ろ</span></span></span><span begin="1:13.840" end="1:14.060">か</span><span begin="1:14.060" end="1:14.400">ら</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">信</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:14.400" end="1:14.660">し</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:14.660" end="1:15.273">ん</span></span></span><span begin="1:15.273" end="1:15.533">じ</span><span begin="1:15.533" end="1:15.963">て</span><span begin="1:15.963" end="1:16.140">た</span><span begin="1:16.140" end="1:16.383">の</span><span begin="1:16.383" end="1:16.580">に</span> <span begin="1:16.580" end="1:17.650">ど</span><span begin="1:17.650" end="1:19.003">う</span><span begin="1:19.003" end="1:19.540">し</span><span begin="1:19.540" end="1:22.260">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">曾让我发自内心相信 为何会</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">kokoro kara shinjiteta no ni dōshite</span></p><p begin="1:22.900" end="1:26.620" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">大</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:22.900" end="1:23.360">お</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:23.360" end="1:23.823">お</span></span></span><span begin="1:23.823" end="1:24.193">き</span><span begin="1:24.193" end="1:24.423">く</span><span begin="1:24.423" end="1:24.820">て</span> <span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">嘘</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:24.820" end="1:25.200">う</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:25.200" end="1:25.600">そ</span></span></span><span begin="1:25.600" end="1:25.880">つ</span><span begin="1:25.880" end="1:26.320">き</span><span begin="1:26.320" end="1:26.620">で</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">高大又满口谎言</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">ōkikute usotsuki de</span></p><p begin="1:26.680" end="1:29.920" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:26.680" end="1:27.080">へ</span><span begin="1:27.080" end="1:27.520">そ</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">曲</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:27.520" end="1:27.803">ま</span></span></span><span begin="1:27.803" end="1:28.180">が</span><span begin="1:28.180" end="1:28.620">り</span><span begin="1:28.620" end="1:28.980">の</span><span begin="1:28.980" end="1:29.220">あ</span><span begin="1:29.220" end="1:29.620">な</span><span begin="1:29.620" end="1:29.920">た</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">性格别扭的你</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">hesomagari no anata</span></p><p begin="1:30.100" end="1:35.800" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">小</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:30.100" end="1:30.490">ち</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:30.490" end="1:30.880">い</span></span></span><span begin="1:30.880" end="1:31.160">さ</span><span begin="1:31.160" end="1:31.560">く</span><span begin="1:31.560" end="1:31.860">て</span><span begin="1:32.040" end="1:32.280">まっ</span><span begin="1:32.280" end="1:32.620">す</span><span begin="1:32.620" end="1:33.020">ぐ</span><span begin="1:33.020" end="1:33.420">な</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">私</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:33.420" end="1:33.840">わ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:33.840" end="1:34.040">た</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:34.040" end="1:35.800">し</span></span></span><span ttm:role="x-translation">与娇小而率直的我</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">chiisakute massugu na watashi</span></p><p begin="1:36.400" end="1:39.740" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:36.400" end="1:36.860">ど</span><span begin="1:36.860" end="1:37.293">う</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby=