="3:12.223" end="3:12.480">そ</span></span></span><span begin="3:12.480" end="3:12.600">じ</span><span begin="3:12.600" end="3:12.760">ゃ</span><span begin="3:12.760" end="3:13.180">な</span><span begin="3:13.180" end="3:16.500">い</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">那些绝非谎言</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">sore wa uso ja nai</span></p><p begin="3:27.340" end="3:32.940" itunes:key="L29" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">弱</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:27.340" end="3:27.560">よ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:27.560" end="3:27.760">わ</span></span></span><span begin="3:27.760" end="3:27.940">く</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">儚</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:27.940" end="3:28.160">は</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:28.160" end="3:28.400">か</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:28.400" end="3:28.800">な</span></span></span><span begin="3:28.800" end="3:29.040">い</span><span begin="3:29.040" end="3:29.660">も</span><span begin="3:29.660" end="3:29.860">の</span><span begin="3:29.860" end="3:30.500">も</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">笑</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:30.500" end="3:30.720">わ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:30.720" end="3:31.360">ら</span></span></span><span begin="3:31.360" end="3:31.560">え</span><span begin="3:31.560" end="3:32.940">る</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">想让脆弱虚幻之物也能欢笑</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">yowaku hakanai mono mo waraeru</span></p><p begin="3:34.023" end="3:39.740" itunes:key="L30" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:34.023" end="3:34.300">そ</span><span begin="3:34.300" end="3:34.520">ん</span><span begin="3:34.520" end="3:34.720">な</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">世</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:34.720" end="3:34.920">せ</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">界</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:34.920" end="3:35.140">か</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:35.140" end="3:35.560">い</span></span></span><span begin="3:35.560" end="3:35.740">が</span><span begin="3:35.740" end="3:36.400">つ</span><span begin="3:36.400" end="3:36.640">く</span><span begin="3:36.640" end="3:37.260">り</span><span begin="3:37.260" end="3:37.480">た</span><span begin="3:37.480" end="3:38.340">かっ</span><span begin="3:38.340" end="3:39.740">た</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">这样的世界才是我所愿</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">sonna sekai ga tsukuritakatta</span></p><p begin="3:40.793" end="3:44.020" itunes:key="L31" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:40.793" end="3:41.080">そ</span><span begin="3:41.080" end="3:41.280">れ</span><span begin="3:41.280" end="3:41.460">が</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">私</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:41.460" end="3:41.700">わ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:41.700" end="3:41.900">た</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:41.900" end="3:42.340">し</span></span></span><span begin="3:42.340" end="3:42.580">の</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">理</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:42.580" end="3:43.200">り</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">由</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:43.200" end="3:43.603">ゆ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:43.603" end="3:44.020">う</span></span></span><span ttm:role="x-translation">这就是我的理由</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">sore ga watashi no riyū</span></p><p begin="3:44.220" end="3:49.460" itunes:key="L32" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:44.220" end="3:44.440">あ</span><span begin="3:44.440" end="3:44.680">な</span><span begin="3:44.680" end="3:44.860">た</span><span begin="3:44.860" end="3:45.080">は</span><span begin="3:45.080" end="3:45.300">ど</span><span begin="3:45.300" end="3:45.700">う</span><span begin="3:45.700" end="3:46.580">だっ</span><span begin="3:46.580" end="3:47.240">た</span><span begin="3:47.240" end="3:47.433">の</span><span begin="3:47.433" end="3:47.640">か</span><span begin="3:47.640" end="3:49.460">な</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">你的答案又是怎样呢</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">anata wa dō datta no kana</span></p><p begin="3:49.900" end="3:59.500" itunes:key="L33" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">教</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:49.900" end="3:50.100">お</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:50.100" end="3:50.600">し</span></span></span><span begin="3:50.600" end="3:50.780">え</span><span begin="3:50.780" end="3:51.000">て</span><span begin="3:51.000" end="3:52.920">よ</span> <span begin="3:53.280" end="3:53.640">ね</span><span begin="3:53.640" end="3:53.880">え</span> <span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">嘘</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:53.880" end="3:54.080">う</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:54.080" end="3:54.600">そ</span></span></span><span begin="3:54.600" end="3:55.020">で</span><span begin="3:55.020" end="3:55.440">も</span><span begin="3:55.440" end="3:55.850">い</span><span begin="3:55.850" end="3:56.260">い</span><span begin="3:56.260" end="3:56.700">か</span><span begin="3:56.700" end="3:59.500">ら</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">告诉我吧 呐 就算是谎言也好</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">oshiete yo nē uso demo ii kara</span></p><p begin="4:00.060" end="4:03.780" itunes:key="L34" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">覚</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:00.060" end="4:00.480">お</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:00.480" end="4:00.960">ぼ</span></span></span><span begin="4:00.960" end="4:01.380">え</span><span begin="4:01.380" end="4:01.600">て</span><span begin="4:01.600" end="4:02.013">る?</span> <span begin="4:02.013" end="4:02.400">あ</span><span begin="4:02.400" end="4:02.840">の</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">場</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:02.840" end="4:03.040">ば</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">所</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:03.040" end="4:03.460">しょ</span></span></span><span begin="4:03.460" end="4:03.780">で</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">还记得吗 在那个地方</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">oboeteru? ano basho de</span></p><p begin="4:03.900" end="4:07.120" itunes:key="L35" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="4:03.900" end="4:04.720">二</span><span begin="4:04.720" end="4:04.960">人</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">描</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:04.960" end="4:05.360">え</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:05.360" end="4:05.820">が</span></span></span><span begin="4:05.820" end="4:06.220">い</span><span begin="4:06.220" end="4:06.440">た</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">夢</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:06.440" end="4:06.840">ゆ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:06.840" end="4:07.120">め</span></span></span><span ttm:role="x-translation">两人描绘的梦想</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">futari egaita yume</span></p><p begin="4:07.260" end="4:13.560" itunes:key="L36" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">偽</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:07.260" end="4:07.700">い</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:07.700" end="4:08.100">つ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:08.100" end="4:08.500">わ</span></span></span><span begin="4:08.500" end="4:08.740">り</span><span begin="4:08.740" end="4:09.400">だっ</span><span begin="4:09.400" end="4:09.580">た</span><span begin="4:09.580" end="4:10.000">け</span><span begin="4:10.000" end="4:10.220">ど</span> <span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">煌</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:10.220" end="4:10.440">き</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:10.440" end="4:10.640">ら</span></span></span><span begin="4:10.640" end="4:11.320">め</span><span begin="4:11.320" end="4:11.953">い</span><span begin="4:11.953" end="4:12.593">て</span><span begin="4:12.593" end="4:13.560">た</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">虽说是虚假之物 却依然闪耀</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">itsuwari datta kedo kirameiteta</span></p><p begin="4:13.760" end="4:16.940" itunes:key="L37" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="4:13.760" end="4:14.020">な</span><span begin="4:14.020" end="4:14.440">い</span><span begin="4:14.440" end="4:14.880">か</span><span begin="4:14.880" end="4:15.020">も</span><span begin="4:15.020" end="4:15.520">し</span><span begin="4:15.520" end="4:15.960">れ</span><span begin="4:15.960" end="4:16.260">な</span><span begin="4:16.260" end="4:16.380">い</span><span begin="4:16.380" end="4:16.580">も</span><span begin="4:16.580" end="4:16.940">の</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">不顾一切追寻着</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">nai ka mo shirenai mono</span></p><p begin="4:17.220" end="4:22.440" itunes:key="L38" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="4:17.220" end="4:17.400">が</span><span begin="4:17.400" end="4:17.733">む</span><span begin="4:17.733" end="4:18.280">しゃ</span><span begin="4:18.280" end="4:18.500">ら</span><span begin="4:18.500" end="4:18.920">に</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">明日</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:18.920" end="4:19.340">あ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:19.340" end="4:19.740">し</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:19.740" end="4:20.000">た</span></span></span><span begin="4:20.000" end="4:20.300">に</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">探</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:20.300" end="4:20.820">さ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:20.820" end="4:21.160">が</span></span></span><span begin="4:21.160" end="4:21.440">し</span><span begin="4:21.440" end="4:22.440">た</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">或许并不存在的明日</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">gamushara ni ashita ni sagashita</span></p><p begin="4:23.740" end="4:27.420" itunes:key="L39" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">大</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:23.740" end="4:24.180">お</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:24.180" end="4:24.600">お</span></span></span><span begin="4:24.600" end="4:25.020">き</span><span begin="4:25.020" end="4:25.240">く</span><span begin="4:25.240" end="4:25.720">て</span> <span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">嘘</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:25.720" end="4:26.020">う</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:26.020" end="4:26.460">そ</span></span></span><span begin="4:26.460" end="4:26.720">つ</span><span begin="4:26.720" end="4:27.120">き</span><span begin="4:27.120" end="4:27.420">で</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">高大又满口谎言</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">ōkikute usotsuki de</span></p><p begin="4:27.540" end="4:30.480" itunes:key="L40" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="4:27.540" end="4:27.940">へ</span><span begin="4:27.940" end="4:28.380">そ</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">曲</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:28.380" end="4:28.700">ま</span></span></span><span begin="4:28.700" end="4:29.040">が</span><span begin="4:29.040" end="4:29.460">り</span><span begin="4:29.460" end="4:29.680">の</span><span begin="4:29.680" end="4:29.860">あ</span><span begin="4:29.860" end="4:30.100">な</span><span begin="4:30.100" end="4:30.480">た</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">性格别扭的你</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">hesomagari no anata</span></p><p begin="4:30.700" end="4:37.220" itunes:key="L41" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">本</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:30.700" end="4:31.000">ほ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:31.000" end="4:31.760">ん</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">当</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:31.760" end="4:32.260">と</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:32.260" end="4:32.440">う</span></span></span><span begin="4:32.440" end="4:33.100">は</span><span begin="4:33.100" end="4:33.640">まっ</span><span begin="4:33.640" end="4:33.943">す</span><span begin="4:33.943" end="4:34.103">ぐ</span><span begin="4:34.103" end="4:34.320">な</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">私</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:34.320" end="4:34.920">わ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:34.920" end="4:35.560">た</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:35.560" end="4:36.180">し</span></span></span><span begin="4:36.180" end="4:36.800">た</span><span begin="4:36.800" end="4:37.220">ち</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">其实都是率直的我们</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">hontō wa massugu na watashitachi</span></p><p begin="4:37.620" end="4:40.660" itunes:key="L42" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="4:37.620" end="4:38.120">そ</span><span begin="4:38.120" end="4:38.520">れ</span><span begin="4:38.520" end="4:38.760">で</span><span begin="4:38.760" end="4:39.160">も</span><span begin="4:39.160" end="4:39.600">そ</span><span begin="4:39.600" end="4:40.000">れ</span><span begin="4:40.000" end="4:40.200">で</span><span begin="4:40.200" end="4:40.660">も</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">即便如此即便如此</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">sore demo sore demo</span></p><p begin="4:40.880" end="4:46.960" itunes:key="L43" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">広</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:40.880" end="4:41.020">ひ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:41.020" end="4:41.120">ろ</span></span></span><span begin="4:41.120" end="4:41.680">い</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">世</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:41.680" end="4:42.100">せ</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">界</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:42.100" end="4:42.520">か</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:42.520" end="4:43.100">い</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">見</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:43.380" end="4:43.533">み</span></span></span><span begin="4:43.533" end="4:43.833">せ</span><span begin="4:43.833" end="4:44.020">て</span><span begin="4:44.020" end="4:44.240">く</span><span begin="4:44.240" end="4:44.460">れ</span><span begin="4:44.460" end="4:45.120">た</span><span begin="4:45.120" end="4:45.740">の</span><span begin="4:45.740" end="4:46.960">は</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">让我看见广阔世界的</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">hiroi sekai misete kureta no wa</span></p><p begin="4:47.380" end="4:57.820" itunes:key="L44" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="4:47.380" end="4:47.800">あ</span><span begin="4:47.800" end="4:48.500">な</span><span begin="4:48.500" end="4:49.100">た</span><span begin="4:49.100" end="4:52.480">よ</span> <span begin="4:53.183" end="4:53.740">さ</span><span begin="4:53.740" end="4:53.920">よ</span><span begin="4:53.920" end="4:54.160">な</span><span begin="4:54.160" end="4:57.820">ら</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">依然是你啊 永别了</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">anata yo sayonara</span></p></div></body></tt>